  {
   "rating": 11,
   "date": "2007-01-06T09:56:51-06:00",
   "body": "So there are two 20 elites and a 21 elite that patrol the area. Watch for them -- their path crosses with the escort, and they're a little tough for a 15.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 5,
   "date": "2005-09-04T03:01:42-05:00",
   "body": "This one was very easy at 15.  I did have a little problem because Miran was not where he was supposed to be.  I had to wait 1-2 minutes before he showed up again, so if he's not there right away, hang out, and he'll pop up.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2006-12-08T11:28:23-06:00",
   "body": "start at cordinates 52,69  ends at 66,66",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 0,
   "date": "2006-03-20T09:56:51-06:00",
   "body": "No problem escorting him, I didn't see any spiders but there was a player who was roaming around a little beforehand and could have killed them.\n\nFor being squishy wasn't a problem here. Just freeze them and blast them all with your fire and arcane spells. Easy as pie. Just make sure a boar doesn't get frozen too, that's what killed me the first time. Stupid pig :p",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 0,
   "date": "2006-09-18T21:56:51-05:00",
   "body": "Pretty much walked the quest - no lvl 20 elite, no spiders, and mobs quickly killed.",
   "replies": []
  },
